  "jw_map": "S2 (Eq. S2 of arXiv:2604.10090) for BOTH protocols (one map, chosen on the baselines only); your SYM numbers (F 0.968, 282 two-qubit gates) were in map S3. Physics (I_PT, exact and Trotter) is map independent to 1e-14.",
  "trotter": "FIX: one Lie-1 step per evolution block; SYM: one Suzuki-2 step. The t0 stage evolves H_L only; backward evolution = same term order with t0 -> -t0 (same_order). Term order = protocols[P].order (indices into terms), the greedy commuting order of the sorted term list.",
