  "qubits": "logical (qiskit) qubit 9 = P (reference), 8 = Q (message), register qubit k = 1..8 is qiskit qubit 8 - k; S2 hosts: psi^1,2 of R on register qubit 1, of L on register qubit 2, pair j >= 3 on register qubit p_j + 1, p = (5, 6, 4, 2, 7, 3) for j = 3..8.",
